{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12682","headline":"与瀼溪邻里 · 元结","name":"与瀼溪邻里","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔年苦逆乱，举族来南奔。\n日行几十里，爱君此山村。\n峰谷呀回映，谁家无泉源。\n修竹多夹路，扁舟皆到门。\n瀼溪中曲滨，其阳有闲园。\n邻里昔赠我，许之及子孙。\n我尝有匮乏，邻里能相分。\n我尝有不安，邻里能相存。\n斯人转贫弱，力役非无冤。\n终以瀼滨讼，无令天下论。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12682.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12682","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}